{"repositoryId":1308648486,"availability":"available","full":"Jou2598/beuniq-design-skill","name":"beuniq-design-skill","description":"Detect and reduce AI-generated UI patterns in frontend code using a local, rule-based system for persistent design quality.","category":"Design","language":"TypeScript","stars":0,"forks":0,"created":"2026-07-22T09:47:15Z","updated":"2026-10-14T07:29:52Z","license":"MIT","branch":"main","homepage":"https://jou2598.github.io","topics":["ai","design-patterns","design-systems","finance-skill","gemini-skills","github-config","hermes-skill","interview","interview-practice","openclaw-skills","phpunit","react","skill-md","system","ui-kit","ui-library","web","webapp"],"demo":"https://jou2598.github.io/","color":"#25392f","ink":"#d1e5c5","lastCheckedAt":"2026-10-17T19:55:43.060Z","lastAttemptAt":"2026-10-17T19:55:43.060Z","lastAvailableAt":"2026-10-17T19:55:43.060Z","metrics":[{"at":"2026-10-17T19:55:43.060Z","stars":0,"forks":0}],"technologies":["React"],"overview":{"kind":"readme","version":1,"paragraphs":["BeUniq helps you improve the quality of your website code. Many AI tools create generic designs that look and sound repetitive. This tool checks your project files to find those common patterns. It acts as a set of rules for your coding assistant. By using BeUniq, you ensure that your design direction stays consistent.","The software keeps your project goals in place. It uses specific files called PRODUCT.md and DESIGN.md to track your instructions. This prevents your AI assistant from forgetting your preferences during long projects. BeUniq runs directly on your machine. It does not send your data to external servers or cloud services."],"features":[],"sourceUrl":"https://github.com/Jou2598/beuniq-design-skill/blob/main/README.md","fingerprint":"d32b9bae19c522212f5a3129b8410d1c7c26b773a8359aa02f04ef1ee3d607f0","extractedAt":"2026-10-17T19:55:43.164Z"},"overviewCheckedAt":"2026-10-17T19:55:43.164Z","projectInsights":{"version":1,"whatItDo